msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫Are "
"you listening, Morgana...?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫……모르가"
"나……, ⟪k:16⟫들려……?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_992E7B91_DD8C_4CFF_BE91_EDCFE80267E8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 72a49823b51dfaf60f3e3ccc84abe6720cb94cef2ac48b78d51da3f78374845b
#. default-sha256: df3ef57c21fc622c37489d3ce6a4eec47e5a42585fdb7e4212777a95d79bed9f
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_992E7B91_DD8C_4CFF_BE91_EDCFE80267E8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I can hear you just fine, my dear.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Now, what brings you all the way "
"up here?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫……네, ⟪k:4⟫들리죠. ⟪k:5⟫어쩐 일이세요, ⟪k:6⟫몸소 이런 데까지 다 오시곤."

#: scenario7:scenario7_871311D2_CE60_4D24_BA59_92D10EF42D9B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a8c90d467e0b1eea274bab7a86b07403bc80ebb4d10c9b41d6a3d759a56f1eff
#. default-sha256: 7a0dd00837e8b56922a1b7212c1fb6d021ca52281490d82144c97b0e563c77ac
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_871311D2_CE60_4D24_BA59_92D10EF42D9B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You know you can call me from anywhere in the house.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫My bonds to this tower have "
"been broken."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫당신이 부르시면 ⟪k:1⟫어디서든 나타날 건데요.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫저는 이미 자유로우니까요……."

#: scenario7:scenario7_E05ECFDB_24A1_463F_AB5C_00E1A7656DB3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c45c6bbc7089678806146aa5cbd8731ce1e53d3d0d9efef5cb5579ec8145aff2
#. default-sha256: 4982a9c3a85777bab82711235609a62259cb66c8d9933c871856fab82508d432
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_E05ECFDB_24A1_463F_AB5C_00E1A7656DB3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫This is a conversation... ⟪k:2⟫we can only have here.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫The place where we first "
"met."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫이 이야기는 ⟪k:2⟫여기서 해야겠다 싶었어.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫나와 네가 처음으로 만난 곳이어야 해……."

