msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫It’s time for us to part ways..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……작별을 고하고 싶어……."

#: scenario7:scenario7_F7AB3616_92DE_45AD_B0C4_0F939BEC3B6F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6ba8453c23dcb1318c214635621e5e5334f4d798501d4bd2f77f8fc67481cb6b
