msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...Exactly."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……맞아……."

#: scenario7:scenario7_CA3F6677_C063_4924_BF31_AA028A2DFDB8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9f7a46dfb183fd564bc3239b23bf767c0931ff68f48557c470bbff99bf13c6ed
#. default-sha256: f0bc524bb711df753fe4456364bb7e43fce442baa24c3bb1014818a8c69ea949
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_CA3F6677_C063_4924_BF31_AA028A2DFDB8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫When I’m with Giselle... ⟪k:2⟫I ⟪k:3⟫am⟪k:4⟫ that.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫She makes me into the "
"person I always wanted to be."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……지젤 곁에 있는 나는…… ⟪k:2⟫내가 바라던 나야.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫지젤이 그렇게 만들어 주었어……."

#: scenario7:scenario7_CAF36A45_977B_4BD2_820A_243C32BC68BA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9e64ce2e04a189c34014795c428d78a0251b3c638046f0f51bd19f7fa2b75fbd
