msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫…………."

#: scenario7:scenario7_EBF8C076_5FC9_4BA2_A55A_73FC3D5FB75E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6ddbc0a0bf11f56994c057b047de334daeb825eb6961dc192a102c0f361ed895
#. default-sha256: 76f6da02f7607696466e99af68d5ffad9e2fd5a18eff0533df80a6a8d2e8b624
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_EBF8C076_5FC9_4BA2_A55A_73FC3D5FB75E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I’m sorry, Michel, but we are kindred spirits—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫as much as you may "
"want to deny it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫유감이에요, ⟪k:3⟫미셸. ⟪k:4⟫당신이 저와 같은 족속이란 건 ⟪k:5⟫틀림없는 사실인데."

#: scenario7:scenario7_D560EA69_8C29_4F9A_96ED_EF2EDD23F22A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e7448e3e265a0d1ac290391bc5d4f9bcef0e9154e93eb71190d46b9062c01006
#. default-sha256: 38ab064052b4212703c80e2ef9d6fefd29441e42d0e26c0f5466f9f7e350e304
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_D560EA69_8C29_4F9A_96ED_EF2EDD23F22A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You could be second to only God, yet you spurn His gift."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……당신에게는 ⟪k:1⟫주님의 아이 되는 자격이 있는데……."

#: scenario7:scenario7_47F1DACD_3876_4775_99A0_E5423BACC6D6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 653a9f46b09da44b26daba7fdc25f8b15f72b400feb84c9f602d73736435d852
#. default-sha256: 5a4bae141cbdb7bad516f5258bc618e4552ae7c38a4b2d09b466a1249315226f
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_47F1DACD_3876_4775_99A0_E5423BACC6D6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I am nothing like you.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I am a human... ⟪k:4⟫nothing more."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫나는 너와 똑같지 않아. ⟪k:2⟫나는 평범한…… 한 명의 ⟪k:3⟫인간이야."

#: scenario7:scenario7_EF62B65E_16C7_4FCC_9043_63A39C0D7251
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 98a5bf8e04a0424c10e178b7f64c48ba89d7b9c4e23f4b3648cd80ec17a55f93
#. default-sha256: 40d32d66498ec70929b243d0a127e6a6a16041c33b20ee7ce0903042ddf9d94b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_EF62B65E_16C7_4FCC_9043_63A39C0D7251"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I shall not condemn you for your unyielding resolve,⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫but rather pity you "
"for being so utterly blind."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫그게 당신의 확고한 결의라면 ⟪k:3⟫저는 뭐라 안 할게요.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫단, ⟪k:6⟫어리석다며"
"―― 불쌍히 여겨 드리겠어요."

#: scenario7:scenario7_96D4E84E_6320_412C_AA0F_42E9605641AA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 709ad0d284eea66990741436c9031666ddf06aa18b9c60a0cf1a23a98e0a4d55
