msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫…………."

#: scenario7:scenario7_180E9105_D7F5_4671_98F6_65D3AADBD25C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eddaa297592a13d4832f85183440d27e7160cf81b3277874a25d9daeedbeb044
#. default-sha256: 7238a96df192316c5b3e5f02f40cc8c4b74856d1ed5bbd608a43c77618c4efcc
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_180E9105_D7F5_4671_98F6_65D3AADBD25C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Allow me to make a prediction before I depart, Michel,⟪k:3⟫cursed namesake of an "
"archangel."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫자, ⟪k:3⟫미셸…… 천사의 이름을 지닌 저주받은 이.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫마지막 예언을 할게요."

#: scenario7:scenario7_9432002E_3B4C_4E54_A621_26ABC935A699
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e75cddf5139cceb7043b4cb12c27f1b1e840b511a5089d612c3e1e9f88b1d635
#. default-sha256: a2ded60c4eb6427e3e435851d48f839dc9953805dd16a259dc702277be99492e
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9432002E_3B4C_4E54_A621_26ABC935A699"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You may think that you’re making some sort of “progress,”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫but the fact of the "
"matter is, you’ve gone nowhere."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫당신은 지금 ⟪k:1⟫첫 걸음을 내딛은 줄 아실 거예요.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫하지만 ⟪k:4⟫현실은 바뀐 게 없어요."

#: scenario7:scenario7_9B8B8197_CE62_4D65_87FC_E0E45E54C0B8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3adb8e066e3f143f56b28c1b63c7c5517a3cd6808197c33085e7cb630f6434ba
#. default-sha256: 481f04cf487637430c57dddb4ba3cda6f839e66c8128d7796771fe99944f5b37
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9B8B8197_CE62_4D65_87FC_E0E45E54C0B8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Will that smile of Giselle’s be able to withstand your secret?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫당신의 진실을 아는 순간, ⟪k:1⟫지젤이 똑같이 웃어 줄까요?"

