"⟪k:0⟫With Morgana’s voice no longer constantly in my ears,⟪k:1⟫my life started to feel like some "
"approximation of normal."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫마녀의 목소리가 안 들리자, ⟪k:1⟫내 일상은 ⟪k:2⟫평범한 인간에 가까워졌다."

