"⟪k:0⟫I wasn’t going to covet what I couldn’t have,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫but I had gotten a taste of that "
"sweet happiness."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫바랄 생각도, ⟪k:1⟫깊게까지 갈 생각도 없었다."

