"with her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫비록 ⟪k:1⟫제가 잿빛 인간이라도――⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫그대와 함께 ⟪k:4⟫평범한 인간이 보내는 인생을 누리"
"고 싶습니다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_F1EE43E6_1C10_4575_9712_103942992DFE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6c4633eb508fa012e9e9935bdc91c3aae3ee92e1791088fd13110220cf81df97
