msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_F1EE43E6_1C10_4575_9712_103942992DFE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She had rescued me from the depths of Hell,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫저를 지옥에서 구해 준 그대를――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_9F07AB5C_30B4_475A_A8F6_0E6D8BF77487
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 59e3cc5f69c08eca40dcea7544ab4cf1d6faa5a2e6f7aa1ee9a3cfe5fe7f586c
#. default-sha256: 6f4f00237a79295a860e69509997952f99886e988ba65b5851c6f81b74d94926
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9F07AB5C_30B4_475A_A8F6_0E6D8BF77487"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and now, I wanted to make her happy."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫이번에는 ⟪k:1⟫제가…… ⟪k:2⟫행복하게 만들고 싶습니다……."

#: scenario7:scenario7_64F6898E_57EF_4289_BFB5_B222403F0EF6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 63a7c59276f6cdead2a6b3b02e82afc134b5d27818a1a4ced6fd4c1ce0ad80f3
#. default-sha256: 154431d1f0b9a68815488349cf3bd9b3f51b401f89099ae25264423da10e02dd
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_64F6898E_57EF_4289_BFB5_B222403F0EF6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫After taking that step in our "
"relationship, I made numerous attempts to reveal the truth about what I was."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫지젤과 내 관계가 바뀐 후로 ⟪k:11⟫수도 없"
"이 내 진실을 고백하려 했다.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫하지만 그때마다 ⟪k:14⟫내 심장이 미치도록 쑤셔서――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_6C6872B9_9964_4589_9AAB_E2986C07D629
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f34645f94cd6548beb63f444edf1cf7b01bddacaac88f7fa6c96184e343693f7
#. default-sha256: 55776c3da7e420f6d088aa333084116b1625df6f216dd0f818d4adc958832098
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_6C6872B9_9964_4589_9AAB_E2986C07D629"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But every time I tried, sharp pain gripped my chest, and my words faded into nothing before "
"they could reach my lips."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫꺼내려는 말을 ⟪k:1⟫꺼내지 못 하게 했다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_12788F89_8B5C_45F9_B9CC_4B68C9BE3FA7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8d8d584694d0d4a82a71a3a9e2e1203eba4d70c92d8aef4acdfc32209165335f
#. default-sha256: 9184a3e9e6e5504aebac6b2252027a396f815d99bb949b4f94c037d3bb276488
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_12788F89_8B5C_45F9_B9CC_4B68C9BE3FA7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I knew that if our relationship were to continue, I would have to tell her eventually, but "
"merely imagining her face twisted in disgust nearly crushed me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫이 관계를 지속할 거라면 ⟪k:1⟫고백해야 한단 걸 알지만, ⟪k:2⟫받아들여지지 않을 순간을 상상하면 "
"막막했다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_8C92BBC9_A4DD_4D1A_9458_5BAC3C1B788E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9205682c4351dddcae312ae477796c5f176cde55575d43ab44903defdb8cfab2
#. default-sha256: 4b7ce8b479b5993f925c08d0183899953b03885860b8c1cf0f76dbc143b1a831
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_8C92BBC9_A4DD_4D1A_9458_5BAC3C1B788E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She was everything to me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫이때는 이미 ⟪k:1⟫지젤이―― 내 모든 것이었다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_43BDAF2C_AF64_4B40_A8B5_5C6E86AB0C24
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9449a29d656b2534350446459001b5fc09f629d70e9d012fcdd20e94aba354b9
#. default-sha256: 32c22ea508f40f274272c0b047bc5514bc845129d202d3259cc4bf773b835d6e
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_43BDAF2C_AF64_4B40_A8B5_5C6E86AB0C24"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And so, as we prepared for our departure,⟪k:1⟫I decided it was time to make some changes."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그렇기에―― ⟪k:1⟫내가 친가로 돌아갈 이 시기가…… 모든 걸 바꿀 순간."

#: scenario7:scenario7_48F79020_CCA1_4468_8E1F_D0A2F86025CC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 17fe9c12b271b79bcbb8e40efda15e757f5ca0991726f83325c38d57f59c8568
#. default-sha256: 068acf89fa08e6ea6f08380880d09ffeb333b9b14ff54121a556403eda0cff8f
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_48F79020_CCA1_4468_8E1F_D0A2F86025CC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was time for me to break out of my rut."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫모든 걸 바꿀 기회로 삼아야 한다―― 판단했다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_0CEE74B5_18BA_4562_92E7_E2B5C97CD85D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c8c7f8f1044b64dfad1f9136a3beb9e3896d7e026bd9d45547bf4bda651a0b63
#. default-sha256: 23868d74502b45046b26b66e50b8ce911ecfa73166aaf22f08e5cf3ac4c137ca
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_0CEE74B5_18BA_4562_92E7_E2B5C97CD85D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And what happened next depended largely on whether Mother and my brothers were willing to "
"accept me as a man."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫어머니와 형들에게 ⟪k:1⟫내가 남자임을 인정받는다면……⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫내 미래도 크게 바뀔 것이다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_11B3562D_CD44_4631_AF5A_545D0959679F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6d6d1df7015c55f487798a0e01885dfc7c5a4b90e2cb3d6bfdee4027e876105c
#. default-sha256: c7548380d4582b08b0fbb93ad7d1bfe91d1d40e786884bed798e879911650da3
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_11B3562D_CD44_4631_AF5A_545D0959679F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫If they couldn’t accept me, then I couldn’t return home."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫반대로―― 인정받지 못 하면 ⟪k:1⟫나는 친가로 못 돌아간다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_CCF542C2_C99C_404A_BDAA_D528F80E096F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 694ec1a8b4cd1b1cc001be1b2c040f0c6970c87de794e26d870b58eea6e399bc
#. default-sha256: 52c8a72a99ed6b716f674cc4d56edace98fabd76335d379013e06a1ce40c8c6a
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_CCF542C2_C99C_404A_BDAA_D528F80E096F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I prayed, from the bottom of my heart, that things would turn out for the best. ⟪k:1⟫That my "
"family would accept me for who I was, and that they would accept what I had with Giselle."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫……나는 진심으로 ⟪k:1⟫미래가 호전되길 기도했다. ⟪k:2⟫어머니와 형들이 내 성별을 인정하고, ⟪k:3⟫"
"지젤과 내 관계를 인정하길."

#: scenario7:scenario7_A5CE85FB_1C46_4588_A207_ACFCBF415BD0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 11c2d0ae48ecd12046becbc0ef5fb2ff79bbe21b978733ae44a5a8b23dbe22ed
#. default-sha256: 64f4513a0ab463cd3e2eb824d09b8404430291ce43c64e0097ca0b7ba20c2a17
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_A5CE85FB_1C46_4588_A207_ACFCBF415BD0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I decided I would tell Giselle everything after I received their responses."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫편지 답장이 오면……⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫지젤에게도 ⟪k:3⟫숨기지 않고 고백하기로 마음먹었다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_E61E2B72_11D6_430E_A56E_0D91B6C50A10
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b795ca82c56cad9f67cb38c351c50593aa80d9d5fa110360ea7d4ab1ba96f58a
#. default-sha256: e885f0023d7183d4aa41130aa693336957a80207e54367226a4706f845940957
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_E61E2B72_11D6_430E_A56E_0D91B6C50A10"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And I hoped dearly that she would join me, wherever I ended up."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그리고 바라건대―― 나와 함께 살아가 주길 기도했다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_81A8C3F9_A2EB_4D8A_8785_C96AD4EAAC78
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8dfec3ac70ff7e0fd39f011493c299768b1a9ac6042b4877e9a4307d48bb922d
#. default-sha256: 6aa3d3543d39df15b797d9fd009c6a079e351fd8a89645861a1fd2a80ca17db6
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_81A8C3F9_A2EB_4D8A_8785_C96AD4EAAC78"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I couldn’t provide Giselle the same kind of happiness a normal man could, ⟪k:1⟫but if she "
"and my family accepted me,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫나는 ⟪k:1⟫평범한 남녀가 누리는 행복을 ⟪k:2⟫지젤에게 못 줄 것이다.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫그래도 가족과 지젤"
"이 인정해 준다면――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_6825304C_7FCC_4EA2_941A_013CBB105902
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4ca6663789abca81a6a6653fb9de84f95dd101b2c2b7c05d6aca3e940a83ad0b
