msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_6825304C_7FCC_4EA2_941A_013CBB105902"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I would do anything I could to build a happy family with her, in my own way."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫내 나름의 ⟪k:1⟫행복한 가정을 꾸릴 것을―― 진심으로 노력하고자……⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫그러⟪k:4⟫려고――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_EE26A5A7_5D28_4939_B54F_8D06D4837FB1
